WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
Open Melt Agent from the desktop.

00:01.500 --> 00:04.000
I check café profit every week. Make me an app from these files.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
The Agent creates Little Hours in a separate app window.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Add a bean-cost control. Set costs to +30%.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.500
Add break-even and a control to close on Mondays.

00:13.500 --> 00:15.900
Close Mondays. The scenario now shows €2,836 monthly profit.

00:15.900 --> 00:18.650
Save Little Hours as a desktop app, including its data and controls.

00:18.650 --> 00:21.500
Close the Agent. Close the dashboard. The app's desktop icon remains.

00:21.500 --> 00:24.500
Open Little Hours from its icon. The same layout, values, and results return.

00:24.500 --> 00:26.500
Use your saved app directly, with the Agent closed.

00:26.500 --> 00:30.000
The app can be edited with the Agent or shared as a copy.
